-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository ships no vendored code. `default.json5` is a configuration
file that Renovate resolves at run time; the resolution is performed by
Renovate itself (https://github.com/renovatebot/renovate, AGPL-3.0-only),
which is neither redistributed nor linked here.

The CI workflow invokes Renovate and Node tooling over the network via `npx`.
Those components remain under their own licenses.
